{"id":"9252d4105cc5f189","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-rosser-sentence.md","title":"Rosser Sentence from a Specified Proof Formula","display":"df-rosser-sentence — Rosser Sentence from a Specified Proof Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-rosser-sentence","aliases":["92-df-rosser-sentence"],"display":"df-rosser-sentence — Rosser Sentence from a Specified Proof Formula","source":"第 VI 章 pp. 79–82；第 VIII 章 p. 104 练习 6（PDF 96–99、121）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-rosser-system]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-rosser-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-rosser-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rosser-sentence — Rosser Sentence from a Specified Proof Formula"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VI 章 pp. 79–82；第 VIII 章 p. 104 练习 6（PDF 96–99、121）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" href=\"?note=d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" title=\"92-df-rosser-system\">92-df-rosser-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be5eece035332f0c\" href=\"?note=be5eece035332f0c\" title=\"92-df-strongly-definable-function\">92-df-strongly-definable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6ed78135d2cc20c6\" href=\"?note=6ed78135d2cc20c6\" title=\"92-df-bounded-quantifier\">92-df-bounded-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span>：固定本地算术系统与所选标准证明公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NegCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{NegCode}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\\)</span>：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" href=\"?note=d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" title=\"92-df-rosser-system\">92-df-rosser-system</a>中的外部码函数与谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为其全扩张：合法公式码按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NegCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{NegCode}_G\\)</span> 取值，非法码取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\nu_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\nu_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\nu_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongDef}_G(\\nu_G,\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongDef}_G(\\nu_G,\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G)\\)</span>；且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\">\\(n,m\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\nu_G;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\leftrightarrow m=\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\nu_G;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\leftrightarrow m=\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G(n)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_2,v_3,v_4\">\\(v_2,v_3,v_4\\)</span> 是不同的辅助变量；量词与实例均使用已定义的无捕获操作。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G,\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G,\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G\\)</span>：本定义引入的符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\coloneqq\\exists v_2\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\nu_G;v_0,v_2)\\land\n\\exists v_3\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;v_0,v_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v_4\\leq v_3\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;v_2,v_4)\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G(F)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\n\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(F;\\bar n))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\bigl(R\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G;\\overline{\\ulcorner R\\urcorner})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\coloneqq\\exists v_2\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\nu_G;v_0,v_2)\\land\n\\exists v_3\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;v_0,v_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v_4\\leq v_3\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;v_2,v_4)\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G(F)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\n\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(F;\\bar n))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\bigl(R\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G;\\overline{\\ulcorner R\\urcorner})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>现在固定点针对明确构造的公式，而非任选一个标准模型等价公式。其语义是：存在自己的证明码，且所有不大于该码的数字都不是否定句的证明码；Rosser 句取其否定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_G\">\\(\\nu_G\\)</span> 的强唯一性使固定数码输入下的内部公式与对应的否定码比较可证等价。</p>\n<p>普通一致性推出双向不可证时，使用正负证明实例的数码验证及算术的有限界展开。只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 在标准模型中表达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\\)</span>，不保证这些内部事实，因而旧的任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 参数不足以支撑 Rosser 定理。界比较是证明码次序，不能直接说成实际证明字符长度。原书第 VI 章以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^*,R^*\">\\(P^*,R^*\\)</span> 的枚举见证构造，VIII 章练习 6 给出可证码固定点版本。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VI 章 pp. 79–82；第 VIII 章 p. 104 练习 6（PDF 96–99、121）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-rosser-system","status":"resolved","id":"d8d7d3ba56a05b13","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-strongly-definable-function","status":"resolved","id":"be5eece035332f0c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-bounded-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-encoding-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f3fdd55235f4984e","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-system","status":"resolved","id":"d8d7d3ba56a05b13","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NegCode}_G$、$\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G$：[[92-df-rosser-system]]中的外部码函数与谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NegCode}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NegCode}_G","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\nu_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongDef}_G(\\nu_G,\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G)","display":false},{"tex":"n,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\nu_G;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\leftrightarrow m=\\widehat{\\mathrm{NegCode}}_G(n)","display":false},{"tex":"v_2,v_3,v_4","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G,\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\coloneqq\\exists v_2\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\nu_G;v_0,v_2)\\land\n\\exists v_3\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;v_0,v_3)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v_4\\leq v_3\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;v_2,v_4)\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G(F)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nF\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\n\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(F;\\bar n))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nR\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\bigl(R\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G;\\overline{\\ulcorner R\\urcorner})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu_G","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"P^*,R^*","display":false}],"bytes":3343,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1547d2395ecc99c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dc82a379ef71435e","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (the fixed internal Rosser-provability formula chosen in [[92-df-rosser-sentence]])"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]与[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness]]给出本地证明码构造与双向不可证性。证明序比较的是自然数证明码，不是字符串长度。"},{"id":"6e56db0129607b23","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)$ (Rosser-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-rosser-sentence]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]"}],"outgoing":["d8d7d3ba56a05b13","e9cc91aaee998c7b","be5eece035332f0c","8bd18c4d476f594a","6ed78135d2cc20c6","482ac6c3f68b4b5b","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","90f32e29c9d553ed","51c43e0240787ebb","f3fdd55235f4984e"]}